{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PIG WITH HIS ACORNS WELL PLACED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help PooPig overcome the hungriest and most selfish crusade ever seen in these pastures. Face off against General Otto Von Squirro's delusional army, wreaking havoc wherever you go with the most absurd weapons and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/6d003af919f2a9d45f42529b37b97f1b.poster.avif?t=1759063757\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/6d003af919f2a9d45f42529b37b97f1b.webm?t=1759063757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/6d003af919f2a9d45f42529b37b97f1b.mp4?t=1759063757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DODGE. GOBBLE. REPEAT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an avalanche of projectiles, strange enemies, and constantly evolving mechanics. Each level in PooPig poses a different challenge:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items under enemy fire.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee from enormous enemies, acquire upgrades that will make you invincible, or die trying.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the madness of those possessed by the craving for acorns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/21bdd83dcaae90c3c0c47182d43a257d.poster.avif?t=1759063757\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/21bdd83dcaae90c3c0c47182d43a257d.webm?t=1759063757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/21bdd83dcaae90c3c0c47182d43a257d.mp4?t=1759063757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORK THAT COMBINES COMICS AND ANIMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement, enemy, and explosion has been animated the old-fashioned way, with love, patience, and a lot of fun. The narrative unfolds through comic panels that combine humor and the absurdity of its plot to create a story that is as fun as it is unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PooPig goes beyond its gameplay, offering a constantly changing visual experience to surprise the player at each stage with new gameplay styles, scenarios, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/f8ac99411ea55b116775edc65eb6ada6.poster.avif?t=1759063757\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/f8ac99411ea55b116775edc65eb6ada6.webm?t=1759063757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/f8ac99411ea55b116775edc65eb6ada6.mp4?t=1759063757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dare to face the fury of our rabid squirrels? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PooPig awaits...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784140?t=1759063757","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/f77024951be3c3bcdfe4b1d87f9a029838de1d25/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759063757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com