mies, and constantly evolving mechanics. Each level in PooPig poses a different challenge:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items under enemy fire.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee from enormous enemies, acquire upgrades that will make you invincible, or die trying.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the madness of those possessed by the craving for acorns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/21bdd83dcaae90c3c0c47182d43a257d.poster.avif?t=1759063757\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/21bdd83dcaae90c3c0c47182d43a257d.webm?t=1759063757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/21bdd83dcaae90c3c0c47182d43a257d.mp4?t=1759063757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORK THAT COMBINES COMICS AND ANIMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement, enemy, and explosion has been animated the old-fashioned way, with love, patience, and a lot of fun. The narrative unfolds through comic panels that combine humor and the absurdity of its plot to create a story that is as fun as it is unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PooPig goes beyond its gameplay, offering a constantly changing visual experience to surprise the player at each stage with new gameplay styles, scenarios, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/f8ac99411ea55b116775edc65eb6ada6